  "description": "A lightweight .NET library for capturing RTSP video frames using GStreamer with direct P/Invoke bindings. Zero NuGet dependencies, supports H.265/HEVC and H.264, hardware acceleration on ARM64 devices (Raspberry Pi, Khadas VIM3, Jetson). Provides precise stream timestamps (PTS) and BGR output ready for OpenCV.",
